              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): చెదిరిపోయింది, cediripōyindi."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Said of a crowd, of clouds and of a dream. Its subject is a thing, so the past shown is the third person: చెదిరిపోయింది, it scattered."
            }
